+<section class="planner" id="planner" aria-labelledby="plannerTitle"><div class="section-head"><div class="section-title"><span class="step">01</span><h2 id="plannerTitle">Plan your next tasting</h2></div><span class="quiet"><svg><use href="#clock"/></svg>Your time. Everyone’s local time.</span></div><p class="section-sub">Pick a moment in your time zone. We’ll take care of the rest.</p>
+<form id="eventForm"><div class="fields"><div><label for="dateInput">Tasting date</label><div class="input-wrap"><svg><use href="#calendar"/></svg><input type="date" id="dateInput" required min="1900-01-01" max="2100-12-31"></div></div><div><label for="timeInput">Start time</label><div class="input-wrap"><svg><use href="#clock"/></svg><input type="time" id="timeInput" required value="09:00" step="60"></div></div><div><label for="hostTzSelect">Your time zone</label><div class="input-wrap"><svg><use href="#globe"/></svg><select id="hostTzSelect" required></select></div></div><button class="primary" type="submit">Find our shared moment <svg><use href="#arrow"/></svg></button></div><p class="field-note"><svg><use href="#info"/></svg>Daylight saving time is automatically considered for your selected date.</p><div class="error" id="error" role="alert" hidden></div></form></section>
+<section class="results" aria-labelledby="resultsTitle"><div class="results-top"><div><div class="result-heading"><h2 id="resultsTitle">Your tasting, around the world</h2><span class="count" id="zoneCount">6 cities</span></div><p class="section-sub" id="eventSummary">One moment. A different local time for everyone.</p></div><div class="result-actions"><div class="toggle" role="group" aria-label="Time format"><button type="button" class="selected" id="format12" aria-pressed="true">12-hour</button><button type="button" id="format24" aria-pressed="false">24-hour</button></div><button class="text-button" type="button" id="addZones"><span style="font-size:17px;line-height:10px">+</span> Add a city</button></div></div><div id="grid" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true"></div><div class="results-footer"><span class="legend"><svg><use href="#check"/></svg>All times adjusted for local daylight saving rules.</span><button type="button" class="share" id="copyEvent"><svg><use href="#copy"/></svg><span>Copy tasting details</span></button></div><p id="copyStatus" role="status" style="font-size:10px;color:var(--green);text-align:right;min-height:12px;margin:7px 0 0"></p></section>
+<div class="closing"><p>Different clocks. Different cups. <em>The same connection.</em></p><span><svg><use href="#coffee"/></svg>Make time for a good cup.</span></div>
